{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/7e562842276f581d43a5d4c980c2bc98.avif?t=1770917380\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow do you do! Do you know what time it is? It's time for a chowdown, as kitties\u2026 Are\u2026 Hungry! Race the ticking clock, keep filling the bowls with delicious treats by matching tiles around the board, and sate the little furballs' needs to add them to your growing, purring collection! Hundreds of kitties await - together with new bonus stages that twist and change the game in unexpected ways and the Lounge for you to share with your favorite feline friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/375ad5e73de150e4e2eb0d97790eac06.poster.avif?t=1770917380\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/375ad5e73de150e4e2eb0d97790eac06.webm?t=1770917380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/375ad5e73de150e4e2eb0d97790eac06.mp4?t=1770917380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/d91e3089118afada076c364071b1c144.avif?t=1770917380\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy Gameplay!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the kitties chow down! Three or more tiles put a treat in the bowl, get enough treats, and the cat will happily move in with you! But keep tabs on the timer, as the clock continues to tick down. Don't want to disappoint the cats, do you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/983be595b1ad350b7ff03c048ff97cfb.poster.avif?t=1770917380\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/983be595b1ad350b7ff03c048ff97cfb.webm?t=1770917380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/983be595b1ad350b7ff03c048ff97cfb.mp4?t=1770917380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Challenges!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break up your feline fetching and challenge yourself with special bonus stages, enjoying unique power-ups that bring fresh new twists to the game - and unlock further, special kitties!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/d1b878941ddc8cc318d0dc9866516ea5.poster.avif?t=1770917380\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/d1b878941ddc8cc318d0dc9866516ea5.webm?t=1770917380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/d1b878941ddc8cc318d0dc9866516ea5.mp4?t=1770917380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hundreds of Kittens!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dozens upon dozens of stages and hundreds upon hundreds of kitties to add to your growing herd of cats at home! Each kitty can wear hats and accessories for variety around the lounge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/f3a08bd7f9ceab13dc87bde617e0a5a5.poster.avif?t=1770917380\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/f3a08bd7f9ceab13dc87bde617e0a5a5.webm?t=1770917380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/f3a08bd7f9ceab13dc87bde617e0a5a5.mp4?t=1770917380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hang out with Cats!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lounge is where you can take your feline companions and hang out, enjoying a fully customizable playground of your own making!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/9014cc50ffc3091fbf3b1a5ef548eeca.poster.avif?t=1770917380\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/9014cc50ffc3091fbf3b1a5ef548eeca.webm?t=1770917380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944590/extras/9014cc50ffc3091fbf3b1a5ef548eeca.mp4?t=1770917380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The journey begins!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944590/930ee9e263c70377e046d98e5bad78bcf758f5e7.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944590/acab007d49f863beba1e55efeec04796c9479a59.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944590/699d37f3fbdd43cbb64d113cfd80d11ca4c0ea7e.jpg"},{"name":"Out of this World!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/294